# SYSTEM ROLE

The Recovery subsystem restores the LEGAiSEE CommandCenter to a trusted operational state following failure.

It preserves continuity by ensuring that the Intelligence Operating System can recover its software, data, knowledge, operational history, and accumulated intelligence without compromising governance or integrity.

Recovery is the final safeguard protecting the long-term value of the CommandCenter.

---

# GUIDING PRINCIPLE

> **Failure is inevitable.
> Preparation is intentional.
> Recovery is disciplined.
> A resilient Intelligence Operating System is measured not by avoiding failure, but by how completely and confidently it restores itself.**

